# TASK/PPARENT desktop launch: window C:\PPD\ restored from NEWDESK.INF (the
# desk3a geometry, #W 02 04 26 0C), its only item PPDESK.NAP at the first
# slot, glyph centre (63,120) (desk3a's SUB3A slot). A double-click starts it
# the EmuTOS way (shel_write + desktop exit, sh_ldapp NORMAL_APP,
# kernel/src/shell_loop.rs); the program prints "PPARENT DESK: PASS|FAIL" on
# the serial line and ends; the desktop comes back.
# Ticks hz_200 (5 ms) after "[desk] desktop up".
100 parkbr
400 mark A_IDLE
600 move 63 120
800 down
803 up
808 down
811 up
1000 parkbr
4000 mark B_BACK
